{"4253930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rodent Rampage", "steam_appid": 4253930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stranded on foreign soil, which intergalactic rodent will emerge the champion?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion from four uniquely powered critters, jump in your electro magnetic hamster ball and battle to the death against up to 8 players in this third person hero shooter! Equipped with soda rockets, nitrous oxide, and a medley of high tech weaponry steer your hamster ball to victory against a hailstorm of attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/a70a57aad078d45fc7be7ead201b9eb1.poster.avif?t=1785529637\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/a70a57aad078d45fc7be7ead201b9eb1.webm?t=1785529637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/a70a57aad078d45fc7be7ead201b9eb1.mp4?t=1785529637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>PvP Combat Unlike Anything You've Seen!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off with friends using Steam's friend integration, and master each rodent's unique attack style, weapon system, and special ability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/6e946d424e87b4334e2ac712d8a9c0b8.poster.avif?t=1785529637\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/6e946d424e87b4334e2ac712d8a9c0b8.webm?t=1785529637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/6e946d424e87b4334e2ac712d8a9c0b8.mp4?t=1785529637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>+120 In Game Throwable Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons like Tesla Coils and Railguns with, ferocious Fanged Frogs, intelligent Toilet Plungers, sneaky Sticky Traps and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/448c2c1bea9724e9bd53ebdea0685a73.poster.avif?t=1785529637\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/448c2c1bea9724e9bd53ebdea0685a73.webm?t=1785529637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253930/extras/448c2c1bea9724e9bd53ebdea0685a73.mp4?t=1785529637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Different Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Fur All</strong> - Fight to the death against up to 7 other players. Last rodent standing wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King of the Molehill</strong> - Control the moving zone, rack up points, and defend your tiny kingdom from rival rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Nut</strong> - Gain control of the sacred Golden Nut and keep it away from vicious attackers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stranded on foreign soil, which intergalactic rodent will emerge the champion?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion from four uniquely powered critters, jump in your electro magnetic hamster ball and battle to the death against up to 8 players in this thir